- Hey brother.

00:00:23.500 --> 00:00:24.850
- Take it away.
- Morning.

00:00:25.979 --> 00:00:27.729
- Jan, hit the stage.

00:00:28.620 --> 00:00:31.150
- Good morning Helsinki,
thanks for having me.

00:00:31.150 --> 00:00:33.230
I'm gonna introduce Jan,
one of the co-founders

00:00:33.230 --> 00:00:34.170
