00:00:38.340 --> 00:00:39.870
- I hope we do.

00:00:39.870 --> 00:00:42.400
- So before--
- Good morning, everyone.

00:00:42.400 --> 00:00:44.670
- Before we go into our keynote,

00:00:44.670 --> 00:00:47.780
