through the digital age

00:27:39.800 --> 00:27:42.750
of transaction and they
look at things like KAK

00:27:42.750 --> 00:27:46.930
and LTV and quant-based
metrics and that's great

00:27:46.930 --> 00:27:49.580
and incredible to get you to a point.

00:27:49.580 --> 00:27:53.490
But the point of my existence
in the marketing landscape

00:27:53.490 --> 00:27:56.620
and where I see all the
opportunity going forward

00:27:56.620 --> 00:27:58.700
has far more to do about brand.

00:27:58.700 --> 00:28:01.700
There are very few people
here that are thinking about

00:28:01.700 --> 00:28:04.870
how to spend five to 25,000 dollars

00:28:04.870 --> 00:28:08.050
to make a video that's
two to three minutes long

00:28:08.050 --> 00:28:12.350
that tells the story, emotionally,
about what they're doing

00:28:12.350 --> 00:28:15.800
and then thinking about how
to distribute that content

00:28:15.800 --> 00:28:19.370
in a Facebook and Instagram
world for another $20,000.

00:28:19.370 --> 00:28:22.460
The amount of people here who
are willing to roll the dice

00:28:22.460 --> 00:28:27.460
on $50,000 on a video on
Facebook to make their world work

00:28:28.300 --> 00:28:29.560
is quite low.

00:28:29.560 --> 00:28:31.470
It's high risk.

00:28:31.470 --> 00:28:33.730
It's not as measurable.

00:28:33.730 --> 00:28:35.930
And it's something that most
people aren't investing in.

00:28:35.930 --> 00:28:40.030
At the same token, I personally
believe that's exactly

00:28:40.030 --> 00:28:42.300
what people need to be
investing in right now

00:28:42.300 --> 00:28:46.950
'cause at the end of this
war, which is what it is,

00:28:46.950 --> 00:28:49.280
don't get confused of
what Apple, and Facebook,

00:28:49.280 --> 00:28:52.540
and Google, and Tencent,
and Alibaba, this war

00:28:52.540 --> 00:28:55.380
where you're going to
see more walls put up,

00:28:55.380 --> 00:28:58.770
not sharing data, that's
where all the money is,

00:28:58.770 --> 00:29:01.930
this war, what's going to happen is

00:29:01.930 --> 00:29:05.550
our worlds are going to become
unbelievably frictionless

00:29:05.550 --> 00:29:08.420
and we're going to be doing
things that are completely

00:29:08.420 --> 00:29:10.520
predicated on brand.

00:29:10.520 --> 00:29:13.120
The number one way for
you to get ready for that

00:29:13.120 --> 00:29:15.700
because I'm not interested in
telling you what's going to

00:29:15.700 --> 00:29:18.550
happen in seven, or nine, or 13 years,

00:29:18.550 --> 00:29:21.550
'cause that is totally not practical.

00:29:21.550 --> 00:29:24.610
The quickest way for you
to understand that world

00:29:24.610 --> 00:29:29.360
is for you to, right now,
become a practitioner

00:29:29.360 --> 00:29:33.100
of Facebook advertising
and Instagram advertising

00:29:33.100 --> 00:29:36.050
in this market or any market
that you're marketing in

00:29:36.050 --> 00:29:38.623
outside of mainland China and Russia.

00:29:39.890 --> 00:29:41.640
You have to,

00:29:41.640 --> 00:29:46.100
have to become a practitioner
of influencer marketing,

00:29:46.100 --> 00:29:50.163
of Facebook media spend, of
creative in these platforms.

00:29:51.240 --> 00:29:55.600
The outsourcing and relying on others

00:29:55.600 --> 00:29:59.710
in social media marketing
is the mass vulnerability

00:29:59.710 --> 00:30:00.943
of this collective room.

00:30:03.040 --> 00:30:06.060
Being a headline reader
versus a practitioner

00:30:06.060 --> 00:30:08.530
is the thing I'm most
worried about in this room.

00:30:08.530 --> 00:30:10.800
Do you know how many people
in this room have opinions

00:30:10.800 --> 00:30:14.950
about Facebook, and Twitter,
and Snapchat, and Instagram,

00:30:14.950 --> 00:30:16.780
and their add product
and their capabilities

00:30:16.780 --> 00:30:19.200
to move their business
without every running an ad

00:30:19.200 --> 00:30:20.033
on the platform?

00:30:22.150 --> 00:30:24.850
My friends, it's almost 2019,

00:30:24.850 --> 00:30:28.110
like, the days of putting
your head in the ground

00:30:28.110 --> 00:30:32.750
and hoping this isn't happening,
or having a very basic

00:30:32.750 --> 00:30:37.090
point of view on these
platforms is coming to an end.

00:30:37.090 --> 00:30:40.360
You've been able to get
away with kind of knowing

00:30:40.360 --> 00:30:42.370
about the capabilities,

00:30:42.370 --> 00:30:45.610
I do not believe that we
have the luxury of that.

00:30:45.610 --> 00:30:47.570
And because of that,

00:30:47.570 --> 00:30:50.243
and then we'll go into Q and
A, Jan, I see you hovering.

00:30:52.170 --> 00:30:54.850
Because of that, for the 30% of people

00:30:54.850 --> 00:30:57.300
that raised their hand
earlier of being entrepreneurs

00:30:57.300 --> 00:31:01.080
or startups, because of that,
this is the greatest era

00:31:01.080 --> 00:31:03.670
to be an entrepreneur or startup ever.

00:31:03.670 --> 00:31:08.670
Because the rules are so
extreme that the incumbents,

00:31:09.140 --> 00:31:11.340
people that have been successful,

00:31:11.340 --> 00:31:14.920
don't have the leverage that
they have historically had

00:31:14.920 --> 00:31:18.770
because infrastructure costs
were deployed against a world

00:31:18.770 --> 00:31:20.760
that doesn't exist anymore.

00:31:20.760 --> 00:31:22.420
You have to understand that.

00:31:22.420 --> 00:31:25.080
The advantages that Bruce, and
I, and others have been able

00:31:25.080 --> 00:31:29.460
to succeed in, those values are
not as valuable as they were

00:31:29.460 --> 00:31:31.870
if were navigating 50 years
ago because the property

00:31:31.870 --> 00:31:35.100
we owned, or the media we
owned, it was more valuable.

00:31:35.100 --> 00:31:39.620
The speed in which your
attention is moving in to where

00:31:39.620 --> 00:31:42.850
is remarkable and the reason you're seeing

00:31:42.850 --> 00:31:47.850
such incredible change,
politically, at a geo level,

00:31:48.350 --> 00:31:51.920
and emotionally, and the issues
that we're facing as humans

00:31:51.920 --> 00:31:55.320
and talking about, whether
it's racism or sexism,

00:31:55.320 --> 00:32:00.320
or nationalism, is happening
strictly because of this.

00:32:00.350 --> 00:32:04.260
Because, as a boy that was
born in the Soviet Union,

00:32:04.260 --> 00:32:08.900
I'm unbelievably aware of
what propaganda and media do.

00:32:08.900 --> 00:32:12.330
We're all becoming a hell
of a lot more aware of it.

00:32:12.330 --> 00:32:15.070
The fact that you have fundamental control

00:32:15.070 --> 00:32:18.430
at incredibly low cost to do that

00:32:18.430 --> 00:32:22.070
for your selfish business ambitions

00:32:22.070 --> 00:32:25.880
with all good intentions,
it's nice to build a business,

00:32:25.880 --> 00:32:28.880
it's great, the fact
that you can do it too

00:32:28.880 --> 00:32:31.050
and you're not taking
full advantage of it,

00:32:31.050 --> 00:32:33.483
is the great miss of your life.

00:32:34.450 --> 00:32:36.062
Thank you.

00:32:36.062 --> 00:32:39.979
(audience applauds and cheers)

00:32:43.930 --> 00:32:45.600
- Alright, alright.

00:32:45.600 --> 00:32:48.436
So, it's time for Q and A.
- Okay.

00:32:48.436 --> 00:32:51.322
- And for this year,
we're going to start--

00:32:51.322 --> 00:32:53.940
- [Woman] Tell me, Obi-Wan Kenobi--

00:32:53.940 --> 00:32:55.980
- We're not gonna go straight to audience,

00:32:55.980 --> 00:32:58.960
we actually have people
from, I don't know,

00:32:58.960 --> 00:33:03.300
future, past, and we're
going to have them appear

00:33:03.300 --> 00:33:06.290
on the screen and they're
going to ask the question, so.

00:33:06.290 --> 00:33:09.263
Can we get the first question, please?

00:33:10.240 --> 00:33:12.429
Let's see what's going to happen.

00:33:12.429 --> 00:33:14.007
(electricity buzzes)

00:33:14.007 --> 00:33:15.729
- [Woman] Help me, Obi-Wan Kenobi.

00:33:15.729 --> 00:33:16.562
(laughs)

00:33:16.562 --> 00:33:17.395
You are my only hope.

00:33:18.295 --> 00:33:21.378
(electricity buzzes)

00:33:22.740 --> 00:33:24.233
Excuse me, sir,

