- Okay, thank you for the--
- Oh, wow.

00:37:48.724 --> 00:37:50.515
(laughs)

00:37:50.515 --> 00:37:52.551
- That's great.

00:37:52.551 --> 00:37:53.860
(electricity buzzes)

00:37:53.860 --> 00:37:56.200
- Okay.
- Okay, bye-bye, Benoit.

00:37:56.200 --> 00:37:57.970
- Are you somewhere here?

00:37:57.970 --> 00:38:00.555
Oh, over here.
- You wore the same shirt?

00:38:00.555 --> 00:38:02.460
(laughs)

00:38:02.460 --> 00:38:03.293
