that allows you the freedom

00:51:13.860 --> 00:51:16.800
to try shit and during an era like this,

00:51:16.800 --> 00:51:21.800
trying shit around Ai, or AR, or crypto,

00:51:21.930 --> 00:51:25.040
Blockchain, is a great thing
