know the alternative.

00:51:38.700 --> 00:51:41.170
If you go all-in on a
project, you're never going to

00:51:41.170 --> 00:51:43.520
be able to figure out, if
you tried other things,

00:51:43.520 --> 00:51:46.810
so this is more about being
optimistic or pessimistic

00:51:46.810 --> 00:51:47.853
as a human being.

00:51:49.280 --> 00:51:51.560
In 10 years, if you
didn't try something else,

00:51:51.560 --> 00:51:53.470
even if you're successful
and you're a pessimist,

00:51:53.470 --> 00:51:56.050
